rative work.","evidence_claim":"Hofstra reports that Axinn Library's renovated 10th floor is a dedicated collaborative and study space with individual and group desks, sofas, and egg chairs.","source_url":"https://news.hofstra.edu/2024/09/23/celebrating-the-librarys-10th-floor-makeover/","source_title":"Celebrating the Library's 10th Floor Renovation | Hofstra University News","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-09-23","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on Axinn Library's 10th floor. Use is subject to current library hours, building policies, and any event reservations.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hofstra-first-gen-lounge","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"First-Gen Lounge","title":"Connect With First-Generation Support","subtitle":"Room 219 in the Sondra and David S. Mack Student Center","notes":"Stop in for first-generation programming and mentorship, and follow the office's official updates before attending a scheduled activity.","short_summary":"A dedicated lounge where first-generation students can connect with support programs and mentors.","evidence_claim":"Hofstra identifies the First-Gen Lounge in Student Center Room 219 and says First-Generation Support and Engagement provides programming and mentorship.","source_url":"https://www.hofstra.edu/admission/deposit-resources/","source_title":"Deposited Student Resources | Hofstra University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Room 219, Mack Student Center. The official page does not publish regular drop-in hours; confirm access or program timing with First-Generation Support and Engagement.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hofstra-multisport-courts","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Hofstra Multisport Courts","title"